        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I7 2.9Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR: 1) Supported for Oculus Touch (Oculus Rift, Oculus RiftS, OculusQuest - Linked, MetaQuest2 - Linked [Quest2 - Linked / OculusQuest2 - Linked], MetaQuestPro - Linked).  2) Supported for Valve Index. 3) Supported for HP Reverb G2 using Valve Index Controllers 4) Pico4 PCVR  5) Potentially supported for other SteamVR compatible headsets (pending testing).<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum recommend is for \u201cLow\u201d graphics settings.</li></ul>",
